# Dart / Flutter (DayBrief)

Read `AGENTS.md` for commands, architecture, and locked paths.

## Lint enforcement

- Style rules live in `analysis_options.yaml`, not in this file.
- Run `flutter analyze` before finishing Dart work; fix all reported issues.
- When on Dart 3.10+, enable `many_lints` in `analysis_options.yaml` instead of expanding this rule file.

## This codebase

- State management: **Provider** + `ChangeNotifier` in `lib/providers/`
- Models: **Freezed** — regenerate with `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`
- Do not add BLoC/Riverpod without explicit request
- Check `mounted` after async gaps in `State` widgets
- Match surrounding code style in each file

## Generated files

Do not hand-edit `*.g.dart` or `*.freezed.dart`.
